            "value": {
              "html": "<p>Ре­ши­те не­ра­вен­ство <span data-inline-latex=\"\\lg^{2} \\frac{(x+2)^{2}(x+5)}{5}\\lt \\lg^{2} \\frac{x+5}{20}\"></span> . </p>",
